nds, or testing new mechanics, Serpent Taggers delivers a simple, skill-based, and addictive experience.\n\nFeaturing smooth locomotion, multiplayer support, custom map", "short_description": "Serpent Taggers \n\nSlither, swing, and sprint your way through Serpent Taggers, a fast-paced, movement-based tag game. Use pure movement and momentum to climb, vault, and launch yourself across unique environments built for speed and creativity. Whether you're exploring maps, racing friends, or testing new mechanics, Serpent Taggers delivers a simple, skill-based, and addictive experience.\n\nFeaturing smooth locomotion, multiplayer support, custom map"}]}, "developer_name": "Serpent Tagger", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vQcKWC_YLCudBk6-iTXU0KU6BUi4f3z2Q7Or4YigPY4RuFi4_tC81ymfTYGbUWEr4vSnMaU__kcwfzC/pub", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Serpent Tagger", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://creeper1212.github.io/Hollow-Tags/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25455902507431247"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_2068201900617382_7728295739196149648_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XSs6bNe0QWUQ7kNvwFVfi11&_nc_oc=AdpZAarzH-9S3GGvuGMr9ZdZiWI